==Trivia==
*Dagshund's name is a play on ''[[wikipedia:Dachshund|dachsund]]'', the breed of dog he is based on.
*Dagshund's Japanese name (だっふんど ''Daffundo'') and description reference [[wikipedia:Ken Shimura|Ken Shimura]]'s [[wikipedia:ja:変なおじさん|weird uncle]] character and one of his famous lines, "Daffunda!"

